{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it. If reached, grab it. Then if heavy, move to destination. Else, scan area. Finally, perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    />  <Action ID = GrabObject    />  <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    />   <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
